            "name": "char_458_rfrost_1#3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Frost",
        "text": "But this isn't a war."
    },
    {
        "command": "playmusic",
        "params": {
            "intro": "$cherimp_intro",
            "key": "$cherimp_loop",
            "volume": 0.4
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_459_tachak_1#2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tachanka",
        "text": "It is to me."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tachanka",
        "text": "When they pull weapons on the Infected and try to kill my friends, it's a war."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tachanka",
        "text": "I've been through plenty of wars in my time."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tachanka",
        "text": "If I can kill even one more *profanity* monster here, it'll give the townsfolk a better shot at survival."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tachanka",
        "text": "I'll make my stand here until I run out of ammo. Until the very end."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tachanka",
        "text": "The battle's not over. How could I retreat?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_458_rfrost_1#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Frost",
        "text": "You're the one who says not to play hero!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_459_tachak_1#2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tachanka",
        "text": "I don't think I'm playing hero, Tina."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tachanka",
        "text": "I'm just doing the right thing."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tachanka",
        "text": "No matter what happens, the show ends here, today."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_458_rfrost_1#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Frost",
        "text": "Alexsandr! !"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_458_rfrost_1#4",
            "name2": "char_503_rang",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rangers",
        "text": "I'm staying too."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_458_rfrost_1#3",
            "name2": "char_503_rang",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Frost",
        "text": "But why...?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_458_rfrost_1#3",
            "name2": "char_503_rang",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rangers",
        "text": "It was always going to turn out like this. We all knew it, from the moment you decided to stay and fight."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rangers",
        "text": "I'll stay behind and help the warrior hold them back. And if things go bad, I'll cover his retreat."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_458_rfrost_1#3",
            "name2": "char_503_rang",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
